# Prompt Lab additions
# Markdown files: ignore all .md files except root README/CLAUDE, docs/reference, and case prompts
*.md
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!docs/reference/*.md
!docs/reference/**/*.md
!cases/**/prompts/*.md
!cases/**/prompts/**/*.md

# Prisma client is generated on install (Phase 03)
apps/api/src/generated/
# CLI output (Phase 17); exported results you want to keep go under cases/<task>/runs/
apps/api/out/

